      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-12T11:47:53.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.25 (vs ₹30.22 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.25 (down from ₹30.22 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹93.8m (down 1.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹13.6m (down 96% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 348% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 9% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 31% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
